@gateway = http://localhost:5001
@direct = http://localhost:5013
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_JWT
@standardToken = REPLACE_WITH_STANDARD_JWT

### 1. Direct Liveness Probe (200 OK)
GET {{direct}}/health/live

### 2. Direct Readiness Probe (PostgreSQL + Redis + RabbitMQ + Wolverine) (200 OK)
GET {{direct}}/health/ready

### 3. Gateway Health Route (200 OK)
GET {{gateway}}/shuffle-api/health/live

### 4. Gateway OpenAPI v3 Schema (200 OK)
GET {{gateway}}/shuffle-api/openapi/v1.json

### 5. Security: Unauthenticated Pool Status Request (401 Unauthorized - RFC 7807 ProblemDetails)
GET {{gateway}}/api/shuffle/admin/pool-status

### 6. Security: Standard User Pool Status Request (403 Forbidden - RFC 7807 ProblemDetails)
GET {{gateway}}/api/shuffle/admin/pool-status
Authorization: Bearer {{standardToken}}

### 7. Admin: Get Live Shuffle Redis Pool Status (200 OK)
GET {{gateway}}/api/shuffle/admin/pool-status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. Admin: Trigger Cold-Start / Idempotent Cache Warming (200 OK)
POST {{gateway}}/api/shuffle/admin/warm-cache
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "forceRebuild": false,
  "triggerReason": "Manual verification check"
}

### 9. Admin: Force Full Redis Pool Rebuild via Catalog gRPC (200 OK)
POST {{gateway}}/api/shuffle/admin/warm-cache
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "forceRebuild": true,
  "triggerReason": "Admin manual force sync"
}

### 10. Validation: Oversized TriggerReason (400 Bad Request - RFC 7807 Validation ProblemDetails)
POST {{gateway}}/api/shuffle/admin/warm-cache
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "forceRebuild": false,
  "triggerReason": "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA"
}
